                },
                {
                  "id": "h-versatility",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Versatility to Take on New Freight Opportunities",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "versatility"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-versatility-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "With new equipment comes the ability to diversify your hauls. Different configurations and features allow you to bid on jobs you may not have qualified for with older or outdated trucks.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-versatility-2",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Expand Into Regional or Long-Haul Routes",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-versatility-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Upgrading to a sleeper cab opens the door to multi-day hauls, which typically pay more per mile. More options mean more revenue.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-versatility-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Meet Specialized Freight Needs",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-versatility-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "From temperature-sensitive goods to heavy equipment, today’s trucks can be outfitted for a wide range of applications.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-versatility-6",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Scale Your Fleet Strategically",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-versatility-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Adding one or two new trucks at a time can help you expand without overextending. Paired with dependable service, you can grow at your own pace.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-operating-costs",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Reduce Operating Costs in the Long Run",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "operating-costs"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-operating-costs-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A common misconception is that <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">new trucks</a> are too expensive for smaller fleets or owner-operators. But when you factor in maintenance, fuel, and repair costs over time, newer models often prove to be the smarter financial choice.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-operating-costs-2",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Lower Maintenance Costs",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-operating-costs-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fewer breakdowns mean fewer <a href=\"/service\">emergency repairs</a>. New trucks are covered under warranty and tend to have fewer issues overall.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-operating-costs-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Better Resale Value",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-operating-costs-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When it comes time to trade in, new models retain value better, especially if they’re well-maintained.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-operating-costs-6",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Financing and Leasing Options",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-operating-costs-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we offer flexible <a href=\"/financing\">financing solutions</a> to help make your next truck more affordable than you might think.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-support",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Work Smarter with the Right Support",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "support"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-support-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Having a new truck is only part of the equation. What really sets your business up for success is having a dealer that backs you with ongoing support and trusted service.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-support-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "feature",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Expert Maintenance & Parts",
                        "intro": "Our <a href=\"/service\">Parts & Service Department</a> is equipped to handle everything from oil changes to major repairs, all done by certified technicians who understand your schedule.",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Personalized Service Plans",
                        "intro": "We work with every customer to build a maintenance schedule that aligns with your routes, usage, and business goals.",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Access to Reliable Inventory",
                        "intro": "Sun State International offers a wide range of new trucks to fit different types of freight trucking operations, from local deliveries to cross-country hauls.",
                        "points": []
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
