                },
                {
                  "id": "h-choosing",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing the Right Truck for Your Business",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "choosing"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-choosing-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not sure where to start? Our team will help you evaluate your business goals, driver needs, and hauling requirements to match you with a truck that makes sense now and years from now.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-choosing-2",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What We Consider:",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-choosing-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "What types of freight do you haul?"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Do you need short-haul, regional, or long-haul capabilities?"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "How many trucks are in your current fleet?"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "What are your growth goals over the next 3–5 years?"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-choosing-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Your truck should help you move more, earn more, and keep your operation running smoothly, and <a href=\"/our-story\">our team</a> will assist you in finding the equipment you need.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-bottom-line",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Bottom Line",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "bottom-line"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-bottom-line-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Freight trucking is an industry built on reliability. Every load, every mile, and every delivery adds to your reputation. Investing in new equipment isn’t just about having something shiny and new; it’s about building a business that’s ready for what’s next. At Sun State International, we’re proud to be Florida’s trusted truck dealership for hardworking businesses. <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">If you’re ready to grow your freight operation, we’re ready to help you do it.</a>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-bottom-line-2",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
